    {
      "id": 36,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        -600,
        0
      ],
      "size": [
        550,
        1130
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 35,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote",
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core",
        "ver": "0.34.0"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## HOW TO: MiniMax H3 Ref2VA Multi-Character (4-Step Turbo)\n\n### 1. Why this workflow is 3090 / RTX Spark safe\n- **4-STEP TURBO? = ON (default):** Uses `minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_4step_v0.1` + **4 steps** (~1.5\u20132 min per 5 s clip on a 3090 once warmed up).\n- Flip **`4-STEP TURBO?` = OFF** to run the **20-step base model** when you find a seed you love and want stronger face lock, motion, and audio fidelity.\n- **`ref_image_size = match`** keeps reference tokens lightweight on VRAM.\n- **`VAEDecodeTiled`** prevents decode OOM spikes (lower `tile_size` to `256` if needed).\n\n### 2. Multi-Character References (`<Picture 1>`, `<Picture 2>`, `<Picture 3>`)\n- Plug your characters/scene into **1, 2, 3** in Group 3 (if you only have 2 characters, disconnect `ref_image_2` from `MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo`).\n- In the prompt, refer to them in exact connection order: **`<Picture 1>`**, **`<Picture 2>`**, **`<Picture 3>`**.\n- For dialogue, write: `(S1) ... <d>[English] Hello there.</d>` and `(S2) ... <d>[English] Right behind you.</d>`.\n- **Optional Start/End Timeline Guides (Group 4):** Bypassed by default. To force a specific first or last frame, load an image and press **Ctrl+B** on its LoadImage + `MiniMaxH3AddGuide` node.\n\n### 3. Safe Resolution & Length (CRITICAL for 4-Step LoRA!)\n- The 4-step Ref2V Turbo LoRA was trained at **~544p**. Keep `ResolutionSelector` at **`0.4 MP` (`864\u00d7480`)** or **`0.5 MP` (`960\u00d7544`)** while Turbo is ON \u2014 don't push the 4-step LoRA to 768p (`0.98 MP`), use 20-step base for 768p!\n- **Duration:** Default is **`5.0` s** (`124` frames \u2248 5.17 s @ 24 fps). H3 snaps frames to `17n + 5` (`5s -> 124`, `6.5s -> 158`, `8s -> 192`). Start at 5 s to avoid long wait times.\n\n| Megapixels | 16:9 Size | Best Mode |\n|---:|---|---|\n| `0.3` | `736\u00d7416` | Fastest draft |\n| **`0.4`** | **`864\u00d7480`** | **Default for 4-Step Turbo** |\n| `0.5` | `960\u00d7544` | Max recommended for 4-Step Turbo |\n| `0.98` | `1344\u00d7768` | 20-Step Base only (heavy on 3090) |\n\n### 4. Requirements & OOM Tips\n- Needs **ComfyUI 0.34.0+** (no custom nodes required).\n- **Important:** Do NOT use the FL2V 8-step LoRA here \u2014 Ref2VA requires `minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_4step_v0.1_comfyui_bf16.safetensors`.\n- Keep **64 GB system RAM** free (weights offload dynamically on a 24 GB 3090). If OOM: lower megapixels to `0.3`, keep duration at `5.0`, or lower `VAEDecodeTiled` `tile_size` to `256`.\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## HOW TO: MiniMax H3 Ref2VA Multi-Character (4-Step Turbo)\n\n### 1. Why this workflow is 3090 / RTX Spark safe\n- **4-STEP TURBO? = ON (default):** Uses `minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_4step_v0.1` + **4 steps** (~1.5\u20132 min per 5 s clip on a 3090 once warmed up).\n- Flip **`4-STEP TURBO?` = OFF** to run the **20-step base model** when you find a seed you love and want stronger face lock, motion, and audio fidelity.\n- **`ref_image_size = match`** keeps reference tokens lightweight on VRAM.\n- **`VAEDecodeTiled`** prevents decode OOM spikes (lower `tile_size` to `256` if needed).\n\n### 2. Multi-Character References (`<Picture 1>`, `<Picture 2>`, `<Picture 3>`)\n- Plug your characters/scene into **1, 2, 3** in Group 3 (if you only have 2 characters, disconnect `ref_image_2` from `MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo`).\n- In the prompt, refer to them in exact connection order: **`<Picture 1>`**, **`<Picture 2>`**, **`<Picture 3>`**.\n- For dialogue, write: `(S1) ... <d>[English] Hello there.</d>` and `(S2) ... <d>[English] Right behind you.</d>`.\n- **Optional Start/End Timeline Guides (Group 4):** Bypassed by default. To force a specific first or last frame, load an image and press **Ctrl+B** on its LoadImage + `MiniMaxH3AddGuide` node.\n\n### 3. Safe Resolution & Length (CRITICAL for 4-Step LoRA!)\n- The 4-step Ref2V Turbo LoRA was trained at **~544p**. Keep `ResolutionSelector` at **`0.4 MP` (`864\u00d7480`)** or **`0.5 MP` (`960\u00d7544`)** while Turbo is ON \u2014 don't push the 4-step LoRA to 768p (`0.98 MP`), use 20-step base for 768p!\n- **Duration:** Default is **`5.0` s** (`124` frames \u2248 5.17 s @ 24 fps). H3 snaps frames to `17n + 5` (`5s -> 124`, `6.5s -> 158`, `8s -> 192`). Start at 5 s to avoid long wait times.\n\n| Megapixels | 16:9 Size | Best Mode |\n|---:|---|---|\n| `0.3` | `736\u00d7416` | Fastest draft |\n| **`0.4`** | **`864\u00d7480`** | **Default for 4-Step Turbo** |\n| `0.5` | `960\u00d7544` | Max recommended for 4-Step Turbo |\n| `0.98` | `1344\u00d7768` | 20-Step Base only (heavy on 3090) |\n\n### 4. Requirements & OOM Tips\n- Needs **ComfyUI 0.34.0+** (no custom nodes required).\n- **Important:** Do NOT use the FL2V 8-step LoRA here \u2014 Ref2VA requires `minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_4step_v0.1_comfyui_bf16.safetensors`.\n- Keep **64 GB system RAM** free (weights offload dynamically on a 24 GB 3090). If OOM: lower megapixels to `0.3`, keep duration at `5.0`, or lower `VAEDecodeTiled` `tile_size` to `256`.\n"
      },
      "title": "HOW TO: Length, Resolution & Multi-Character Ref2VA",
      "color": "#233",
      "bgcolor": "#355"
    },
